  <item>
    <title>night 99—花儿与少年之我的旅行搭子居然是MB?!(石榴版）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acc284de742e36efcc171e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acc284de742e36efcc171e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:33:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《石榴的青甘大环线》</span></p><p></p><p><span>去不一样的地方看一看。</span></p><p><span>走进沙漠，走上公路；把城市留在身后，让世界迎面而来。</span></p><p><span>从工作里抽身，从如常里抽身，从一成不变里抽身，从按部就班里抽身。</span></p><p><span>在陌生之地，看熟悉的风景。用自己的眼睛，站着看，坐着看，躺着看，都行。</span></p><p><span>把喜欢的诗读给大风，把最爱的歌唱给雨水。</span></p><p><span>今夜我不关心人类，我只想你。</span></p><p><span>MUSIC</span></p><p><span>花儿与少年</span></p><p><span>石榴的青甘大环线：</span></p><p><span>青海湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5Vdyx-6K36uFiqxP9vAUKfZTmC.jpg"><p><span>察尔汗盐湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llp9fxd0dD5Ft-jJT9f1OOnpdipA.jpg"><p><span>可可西里·索南达杰保护站</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnA6f4qICR1oHVf0PBIb5fk5snMP.jpg"><p><span>大柴旦·翡翠湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYo9-cBI_BT1qDAQKT1EVnauMvp.jpg"><p><span>大柴旦·水上雅丹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu94Y9KfX0kDMdChZdLXTSXFfdOn.jpg"><p><span>冷湖镇·石油小镇遗址</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEHv5GHAU96IwI1QazY5fD6p9Px.jpg"><p><span>冷湖镇·黑独山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJOyq1cx-s_D-sRhLa6ur58YvrH.jpg"><p><span>敦煌·鸣沙山月牙泉</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkNafMONFKMvPHCkDVy9ytXXU1g.jpg"><p><span>张掖·七彩丹霞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqtAVaB3hrC3_pCrQDUH5Eew0I6-.jpg"><p><span>二尕公路·祁连山脉</span></p><p><span>二尕公路·祁连山脉</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDGqVM_umkMZsyQbVLHpPyQ3qyG.jpg"><p><span>二尕公路·祁连山脉</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvzIduBOwlbO2gO66pAD0QXT7NEi.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
